cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article and this archive."
title: "LipidScore-DDLPS: analysis code for a six-gene lipid-metabolism score in dedifferentiated liposarcoma"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23274039
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wqxrmyy/LipidScore_DDLPS"
url: "https://github.com/wqxrmyy/LipidScore_DDLPS"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, figure code and governance locks behind a six-gene lipid
  metabolism score for dedifferentiated liposarcoma (DDLPS): single-cell
  processing of GSE221493, TCGA-SARC and GSE cohort analysis, the score
  definition and its end points, two independent implementations of the bulk
  validation, and the assertions that tie code output to the reported values.
  The archive does not contain the source data, which are third-party and
  public; see DATA_SOURCES.md for accessions.
keywords:
  - dedifferentiated liposarcoma
  - lipid metabolism
  - prognostic score
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - reproducibility
authors:
